cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use qmesh in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "qmesh: a 2026-native quantum operating layer"
abstract: >-
  qmesh is a modality-agnostic quantum IR with an AI-augmented compiler,
  fault-tolerant-mode scheduling, and reproducibility-as-runtime across
  gate-based, neutral-atom analog, photonic-CV, and pulse-level backends.
type: software
